# Input

```html
<p>a <em>b</em> c
<u>d</u></p>

<p>
  Text with <strong>bold</strong>, <em>italic</em>, and
  <u>underlined</u>.
</p>

```


# Formatted

```html
<p>a <em>b</em> c <u>d</u></p>

<p>Text with <strong>bold</strong>, <em>italic</em>, and <u>underlined</u>.</p>

```
